{'symbol': 'HOLX', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'HOLOGIC, INC. LAUNCHES DEFINITY™ CERVICAL DILATOR TO PROVIDE GENTLE AND SEAMLESS DILATION DURING GYNECOLOGIC PROCEDURES', 'text': 'HOLOGIC, INC. LAUNCHED THE DEFINITY™ CERVICAL DILATOR, A MAJOR ADVANCEMENT FOR GYNECOLOGICAL PROCEDURES THAT USES SUREACCESS™ BALLOON TECHNOLOGY TO GENTLY AND EFFORTLESSLY ACCESS UTERINE CAVITIES WITHOUT A TENACULUM, LESSENING PATIENT DISCOMFORT AND REDUCING RISK OF PERFORATION DURING DILATION. USING SUREACCESS BALLOON TECHNOLOGY, THE DEFINITY DILATOR IS DESIGNED TO ELIMINATE MULTIPLE PASSES AND MINIMIZE FALSE TRACKING, REDUCING INJURY TO THE CERVIX, EVEN IN PATIENTS WITH COMPLEX OR CHALLENGING CERVICAL ANATOMY. THE DEFINITY DILATOR IS COMMERCIALLY AVAILABLE IN THE U.S. AND COMES IN MULTIPLE SIZES (5 MM, 7 MM AND 9 MM) TO ACCOMMODATE A WIDE VARIETY OF PROCEDURES. THE PRODUCT WAS DEVELOPED IN PARTNERSHIP WITH CROSSBAY MEDICAL, INC., AND WILL BE FEATURED ALONG WITH OTHER DEVICES IN THE HOLOGIC SUITE OF SURGICAL SOLUTIONS DURING THE AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF GYNECOLOGIC LAPAROSCOPISTS (AAGL) ANNUAL MEETING FROM NOVEMBER 8 TO NOVEMBER 13 AT BOOTH #913.'}{'symbol': 'HOLX', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'HOLOGIC, INC. LAUNCHES DEFINITY™ CERVICAL DILATOR TO PROVIDE GENTLE AND SEAMLESS DILATION DURING GYNECOLOGIC PROCEDURES', 'text': 'HOLOGIC, INC. LAUNCHED THE DEFINITY™ CERVICAL DILATOR, A MAJOR ADVANCEMENT FOR GYNECOLOGICAL PROCEDURES THAT USES SUREACCESS™ BALLOON TECHNOLOGY TO GENTLY AND EFFORTLESSLY ACCESS UTERINE CAVITIES WITHOUT A TENACULUM, LESSENING PATIENT DISCOMFORT AND REDUCING RISK OF PERFORATION DURING DILATION. USING SUREACCESS BALLOON TECHNOLOGY, THE DEFINITY DILATOR IS DESIGNED TO ELIMINATE MULTIPLE PASSES AND MINIMIZE FALSE TRACKING, REDUCING INJURY TO THE CERVIX, EVEN IN PATIENTS WITH COMPLEX OR CHALLENGING CERVICAL ANATOMY. THE DEFINITY DILATOR IS COMMERCIALLY AVAILABLE IN THE U.S. AND COMES IN MULTIPLE SIZES (5 MM, 7 MM AND 9 MM) TO ACCOMMODATE A WIDE VARIETY